# Dwarf

## Lore

The Dwarves of the Palladium World are short, powerfully built, bronze-skinned people who once co-ruled that world beside the Elves, until thousands of years of Elven contempt ended in the Six Thousand Year War that destroyed both empires. Horrified by what their magic had done, the Dwarves destroyed their tomes and swore never to practice it again; they turned instead to warfare and metalsmithing and are Palladium''s finest weapon and armor smiths.

On Rifts Earth they are rare - adventurers or victims of circumstance - but those who arrive take quickly to technology, and second and third generation Earth Dwarves are often masterful Operators, Rogue Scientists, City Rats, arms dealers, salvage experts, gunfighters, lawmen, Headhunters and even full conversion cyborgs. A few hundred live and work at Northern Gun, the Manistique Imperium and Triax. Some have even taken up Techno-Wizardry, which echoes their lost rune magic.

**Alignment:** Any.

**Size:** 3 to 4 feet; three feet plus 3D4+2 inches. **Weight:** 150 to 200 pounds.

**Average Life Span:** 250+ years; some have lived to 500.

## GM Notes

Dwarves are disciplined, gruff and short tempered, especially with Elves. Traditional enemies are Elves, Wolfen, Ogres, Trolls, Kobolds, Goblins and Hob-Goblins, and most still resent Giants and Changelings. They like humans and ally with them against giants, monsters and the supernatural, on Palladium and across the Megaverse. Most love magic items, high-tech weapons, robots, military vehicles, cybernetics and bionics.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'rifts-dwarf');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'rifts-dwarf';

